        "text": "truly, bias for action—more than any other trait—is the trait that seems most correlated with success and impact\n\nit is SO much better to be constantly shipping, making mistakes, and learning than to be smart, cynical, paralyzed &amp; inert\n\nget out there—go do some shit!"
